# Keil MDK generated files

# Build output
Objects/
Listings/
Output/
Debug/

# Keil project temporary files
*.uvguix.*
*.uvoptx
*.uvprojx.user

# Compiled files
*.axf
*.hex
*.bin
*.elf
*.o
*.obj
*.lib

# Keil per-target build intermediates (keep .uvprojx, .ioc, source, and RTE config)
**/MDK-ARM/*/*.crf
**/MDK-ARM/*/*.d
**/MDK-ARM/*/*.dep
**/MDK-ARM/*/*.htm
**/MDK-ARM/*/*.lnp
**/MDK-ARM/*/*.sct
**/MDK-ARM/*/*.axf
**/MDK-ARM/*/*.hex
**/MDK-ARM/*/*.bin
**/MDK-ARM/*/*.map

# Listing files
*.lst
*.map

# Backup files
*.bak
*.tmp

# VS Code
.vscode/

# System files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# 驱动程序和商家上位机
*.exe

# 临时或完整商家资料包
硬件资料（部分已有）/V3/

# 商家宣传视频、压缩分发包和临时文件
*.mp4
*.avi
*.rar
*.7z
